          "request": {
            "name": "Premium: Risk factors",
            "description": {
              "content": "The risk factors endpoint is a Premium endpoint that returns a risk factor score for each BeZero rated project. The risk factors can have a score of aaa, aa, a, bbb, bb, b, c, d. Ratings, risk factors and summary analysis are always updated together so users are recommended to get the rating, rating detail and risk factors when requesting updates. Otherwise rating, rating summary and risk factor scores will be out of sync.\n",
